    "detailed_description": "Can a single Unreal Engine developer create a decent online multiplayer shooter with little to no budget?<br />\r\nYes!<br />\r\nCan I compete with AAA studios?<br />\r\nNo But, This game does has game-modes you know from AAA games in this genre and will try to mimic the overall look and feel of modern day shooters.<br />\r\nCombined with state of the art graphics and a fully dynamic time and weather system!<br />\r\n(you should bring a beefy computer to optimally experience the graphics at it fullest. But it can always be tuned to lower end hardware in the settings menu.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has tree game modes you can play with your friends<br />\r\n  -  Conquest, Dominate the capture points and kill the enemy in order to win with your team<br />\r\n  -  Rush, Try to detonate a series of bombs, or try to defend them.<br />\r\n  -  Free for All, just want to aimlessly shoot everything that moves? we got you covered!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery game mode has it's own unique map that is designed with care and passion. <br />\r\nI'm planning to add more maps and game modes during the further development of this game.<br />\r\nThe best part: you can be part of it. Because I'm always open to suggestions via the FleurBird YouTube channel's comment section.<br />\r\nmost parts of the development will also be documented and can be found at the same channel.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCome and see for yourself!",
    "about_the_game": "Can a single Unreal Engine developer create a decent online multiplayer shooter with little to no budget?<br />\r\nYes!<br />\r\nCan I compete with AAA studios?<br />\r\nNo But, This game does has game-modes you know from AAA games in this genre and will try to mimic the overall look and feel of modern day shooters.<br />\r\nCombined with state of the art graphics and a fully dynamic time and weather system!<br />\r\n(you should bring a beefy computer to optimally experience the graphics at it fullest. But it can always be tuned to lower end hardware in the settings menu.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has tree game modes you can play with your friends<br />\r\n  -  Conquest, Dominate the capture points and kill the enemy in order to win with your team<br />\r\n  -  Rush, Try to detonate a series of bombs, or try to defend them.<br />\r\n  -  Free for All, just want to aimlessly shoot everything that moves? we got you covered!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery game mode has it's own unique map that is designed with care and passion. <br />\r\nI'm planning to add more maps and game modes during the further development of this game.<br />\r\nThe best part: you can be part of it. Because I'm always open to suggestions via the FleurBird YouTube channel's comment section.<br />\r\nmost parts of the development will also be documented and can be found at the same channel.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCome and see for yourself!",
